<title>SYRIA: Syria's Assad meets Sudanese foreign minister.</title>
<headline>Syria's Assad meets Sudanese foreign minister.</headline>
<dateline>DAMASCUS 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syrian President Hafez al-Assad met Sudan's Foreign Minister Ali Osman Mohammad Taha shortly after he arrived in Damascus on Monday on a previously unannounced visit.</p>
<p>Presidential spokesman Joubran Kourieh said that Syrian Foreign Minister Farouq al-Shara attended the meeting at the presidential palace in the Syrian capital. He gave no details.</p>
</text>
